      "message": "Merge main into issue/938-tilt-tolerance (rapids_posed.rs, solid.rs: keep both sides)\n\nConflicts: main's new hits() argument (&[] / hole-wall axes, #1073-era)\nkept with the branch's is_upright predicate. Re-applied is_upright at\nmain's new #1091 stock-top site (stock_top.rs), which had its own 1e-12\ncomponent test. tilt_tolerance.rs takes ..Default::default() for main's\nnew VerifyContext::model_excess (review blocker).\n\nRefs #938\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
