      "message": "fix(sim): law (c) de-dups only its own per-move report; pin #938 at the stock-top site\n\nLaw (c)'s ShankHit de-duplication compared against warns.last(), which an\nearlier law (b2) may have pushed; it now tracks its own last verdict for\nthe move. Pin: a 1e-10 deg pose is an upright dive at the #1091 stock-top\nre-read, a 0.001 deg lean keeps its conviction. rustfmt nit in upright.rs.\n\nRefs #938\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
